        "TileImage": "$($repository 1c00525f-cd44-49fa-aff8-c70d2388f031).Image",
        "Description": "Within the most powerful secret society was born a secret alliance. 4 men, together, swore to destroy the masters they serve. They call themselves The 4 horsemen of vengeance. \r\rTonight is the night, they will act. \r\rYou cannot let that happen, we live in a world where the greedy and corrupts are in power. Make sure it stays that way. Also our beloved leaders don&apos;t like to see blood, they prefer to pretend they harm no one, try not to be spotted. \r\rGood luck",
